      <p>To create a cluster with multi-architecture compute machines on {"{"}{"{"} ibm_z_name {"}"}{"}"} and {"{"}{"{"} ibm_linuxone_name {"}"}{"}"} (<code>s390x</code>) in a logical partition (LPAR), you must have an existing single-architecture <code>x86_64</code> cluster. You can then add <code>s390x</code> compute machines to your OpenShift Container Platform cluster.</p>
